                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t156ajMm",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#6f6a59",
                          "content": "AGENT ACTIVITY \u00b7 4/5 steps  \u25be",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t157k8Wm",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#221f18",
                          "content": "\u2713  Read learning state",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t158G9dR",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#6f6a59",
                          "content": "   Mastery \u2014 SN2 92% \u00b7 Stereochemistry 45% \u00b7 Nucleophilicity 74%",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t159aIx7",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#221f18",
                          "content": "\u2713  Retrieved evidence",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t160AQ8t",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#6f6a59",
                          "content": "   search_sources(\"backside attack stereochemistry\")",
                          "fontFamily": "JetBrains Mono",
                          "fontSize": 11,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t161S8Mt",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#221f18",
                          "content": "\u2713  Reasoning",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t162eSMW",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#6f6a59",
                          "content": "   Anchor on trigonal-bipyramidal transition state and umbrella-flip analogy.",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 12,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t163zbGR",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#2f6f4f",
                          "content": "\u25cc  Composing answer\u2026",
                          "fontFamily": "Inter",
                          "fontSize": 13,
                          "fontWeight": "normal"
                        }
                      ],
                      "gap": 8,
                      "padding": 12,
                      "cornerRadius": 6,
                      "stroke": "#e2d8c1",
                      "strokeWidth": 1
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "frame",
                      "id": "f1676t6G",
                      "name": "prose",
                      "x": 0,
                      "y": 0,
                      "width": 716,
                      "height": 120,
                      "fill": "#faf6ed",
                      "layout": "vertical",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t165VFfF",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#221f18",
                          "content": "In an SN2 reaction the nucleophile approaches from the side directly opposite the leaving group. As the new bond forms, the three remaining substituents are pushed through a flat, trigonal-bipyramidal transition state \u2014 like an umbrella turning inside-out in the wind.",
                          "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 700
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "id": "t166An9F",
                          "name": "text",
                          "fill": "#221f18",
                          "content": "Because bond-making and bond-breaking happen in one concerted step, the stereocentre inverts: the product is the mirror configuration \u2014 a Walden inversion.",
                          "fontFamily": "Newsreader",
                          "fontSize": 15,
                          "fontWeight": "normal",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": 700
                        }
                      ],
                      "gap": 8
                    },
